00:02:07.030 --> 00:02:09.229
leave that to legal scholars, that judicial
review.

00:02:09.229 --> 00:02:13.129
What you're talking about with judicial review
is essentially review by the Supreme Court

00:02:13.129 --> 00:02:14.129
of the constitutionality of legislative act.

00:02:14.129 --> 00:02:19.069
So it's sort of a melding of what are legislative
acts carried out by the House and Senate and

00:02:19.069 --> 00:02:21.269
the president, and then comparing and contrasting
that with the Constitution, the Constitution

00:02:21.269 --> 00:02:23.040
Bill of Rights, and seeing whether it is coherent
with that.

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:26.004
And it is sort of like an ultimate final word
in a sense, on the decisions that are made

00:02:26.004 --> 00:02:27.004
